.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH rev-stealth-config-validate 1  "rev-stealth-config-validate " 
.SH NAME
rev\-stealth\-config\-validate \- Run the P5.1 validate engine over the live config files. Exit 0 on LGTM; exit 1 with structured issue list on violations
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBrev\-stealth config validate\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run the P5.1 validate engine over the live config files. Exit 0 on LGTM; exit 1 with a structured issue list on violations.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.SH EXTRA
EXAMPLES:
  $ rev\-stealth config validate
  $ rev\-stealth config \-\-output\-format json validate

EXIT CODES:
  0  Ok               No violations.
  1  UserError        Validation violations (issue list emitted).
  3  PermanentError   Config IO / parse failure.

ENV:
  REV_SCRAPING_HOME            Override `~/.rev_scraping/` base.
  REV_SCRAPING_CONFIG_LENIENT  Loosen strictness for test/CI.
